{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 2,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My son, if thou wilt receive my words,\nAnd lay up my commandments with thee;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So as to incline thine ear unto wisdom,\nAnd apply thy heart to understanding;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yea, if thou cry after discernment,\nAnd lift up thy voice for understanding;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If thou seek her as silver,\nAnd search for her as for hid treasures:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then shalt thou understand the fear of Jehovah,\nAnd find the knowledge of God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For Jehovah giveth wisdom;\nOut of his mouth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "cometh",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " knowledge and understanding:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He layeth up sound wisdom for the upright;",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "He is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a shield to them that walk in integrity;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That he may guard the paths of justice,And preserve the way of his saints.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then shalt thou understand righteousness and justice,\nAnd equity, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "yea",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", every good path.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For wisdom shall enter into thy heart,\nAnd knowledge shall be pleasant unto thy soul;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Discretion shall watch over thee;\nUnderstanding shall keep thee:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To deliver thee from the way of evil,\nFrom the men that speak perverse things;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who forsake the paths of uprightness,\nTo walk in the ways of darkness;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who rejoice to do evil,\nAnd delight in the perverseness of evil;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who are crooked in their ways,\nAnd wayward in their paths:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To deliver thee from the strange woman,\nEven from the foreigner that flattereth with her words;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That forsaketh the friend of her youth,\nAnd forgetteth the covenant of her God:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For her house inclineth unto death,\nAnd her paths unto the dead;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "None that go unto her return again,\nNeither do they attain unto the paths of life:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That thou mayest walk in the way of good men,\nAnd keep the paths of the righteous.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the upright shall dwell in the land,\nAnd the perfect shall remain in it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.2.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.2.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the wicked shall be cut off from the land,And the treacherous shall be rooted out of it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
